{"id":8859737686215,"title":"Personalized Celtic Tree of Life Yggdrasil Quilt Sets - Celtic Design","handle":"personalized-celtic-tree-of-life-yggdrasil-quilt-sets-celtic-design","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the symbolism of resilience and interconnectedness with this beautiful Jeminise Quilt Set, featuring the stunning Tree of Life design. Perfect for adding a touch of meaningful decor to your home or as a thoughtful gift for loved ones, this quilt offers warmth and comfort throughout all seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAmazing Yggdrasil Quilt Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features the iconic Tree of Life, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to perfectly fit various bed sizes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProfessional Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted with specially designed colorful themes on smooth material, suitable for both functional use and decorative appeal.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An ideal gift for housewarmings, weddings, or special occasions, perfect for family members like moms, dads, sisters, brothers, grandmas, grandpas, wives, husbands, sons, and daughters.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Comes with 1 Quilt, with an optional Pillowcase.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Provides warmth for indoor and outdoor use, ideal for beds, sofas, readin